/Title (Cornerstone Craftsman has a strong history of supporting court-involved youth, having worked with 12 young people navigating the juvenile justice system, receiveing direct advocacy and ongoing support through our program. In 2025, our team attended more than 30 court dates, standing alongside youth and their families to ensure access to opportunity, accountability, and fair outcomes. Through consistent presence, documentation support, workforce preparation, and mentorship, Cornerstone Craftsman successfully advocated for positive resolutions in these eight cases, helping youth remain in their communities and on a path toward stability and success.)
